    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on an intriguing adventure, where you have been summoned by a powerful God, on a mission: to recover the sacred balls that were stolen from this God.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/37a652c315f046ae6cc3bbb6ba3633a0.poster.avif?t=1751470467\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/37a652c315f046ae6cc3bbb6ba3633a0.webm?t=1751470467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/37a652c315f046ae6cc3bbb6ba3633a0.mp4?t=1751470467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The stolen balls.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up the balls that are scattered across different levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several balls of different colors to be captured.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find them, capture them and take them to the boxes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/ef65f95996958cc64ecab9aafad98736.poster.avif?t=1751470467\" width=600 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/ef65f95996958cc64ecab9aafad98736.webm?t=1751470467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/ef65f95996958cc64ecab9aafad98736.mp4?t=1751470467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Store the balls in the boxes, to return the balls to the God who takes care of these balls</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each box has the same color as the ball.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boxes are a portal for the balls to reach the God.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you reach certain numbers of stored balls, something will happen.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/421d293b8c94ae84410d78a3f9b24908.poster.avif?t=1751470467\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/421d293b8c94ae84410d78a3f9b24908.webm?t=1751470467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/421d293b8c94ae84410d78a3f9b24908.mp4?t=1751470467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock new levels according to how many balls were stored in the boxes.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has a different visual aspect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At each level, the challenges will increase in complexity to be solved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has a specific number of balls to be collected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each new level, the number of balls to be captured also increased.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/c4c442281f1637c2ed93cc439a311af0.poster.avif?t=1751470467\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/c4c442281f1637c2ed93cc439a311af0.webm?t=1751470467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/c4c442281f1637c2ed93cc439a311af0.mp4?t=1751470467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The challenges of each level will become more difficult.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a learning curve for each puzzle, one puzzle teaches you something about the next puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles are to free access to the ball, some other puzzles are to free the exit from the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to complete the puzzles to progress in the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on an intriguing adventure, where you have been summoned by a powerful God, on a mission: to recover the sacred balls that were stolen from this God.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/37a652c315f046ae6cc3bbb6ba3633a0.poster.avif?t=1751470467\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/37a652c315f046ae6cc3bbb6ba3633a0.webm?t=1751470467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/37a652c315f046ae6cc3bbb6ba3633a0.mp4?t=1751470467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The stolen balls.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up the balls that are scattered across different levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several balls of different colors to be captured.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find them, capture them and take them to the boxes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/ef65f95996958cc64ecab9aafad98736.poster.avif?t=1751470467\" width=600 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/ef65f95996958cc64ecab9aafad98736.webm?t=1751470467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/ef65f95996958cc64ecab9aafad98736.mp4?t=1751470467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Store the balls in the boxes, to return the balls to the God who takes care of these balls</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each box has the same color as the ball.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boxes are a portal for the balls to reach the God.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you reach certain numbers of stored balls, something will happen.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/421d293b8c94ae84410d78a3f9b24908.poster.avif?t=1751470467\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/421d293b8c94ae84410d78a3f9b24908.webm?t=1751470467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/421d293b8c94ae84410d78a3f9b24908.mp4?t=1751470467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock new levels according to how many balls were stored in the boxes.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has a different visual aspect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At each level, the challenges will increase in complexity to be solved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has a specific number of balls to be collected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each new level, the number of balls to be captured also increased.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/c4c442281f1637c2ed93cc439a311af0.poster.avif?t=1751470467\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/c4c442281f1637c2ed93cc439a311af0.webm?t=1751470467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243590/extras/c4c442281f1637c2ed93cc439a311af0.mp4?t=1751470467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The challenges of each level will become more difficult.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a learning curve for each puzzle, one puzzle teaches you something about the next puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles are to free access to the ball, some other puzzles are to free the exit from the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to complete the puzzles to progress in the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
